{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/opaqueenrollment(password:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"opaqueEnrollment"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"password"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK16OpaqueEnrollmentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OpaqueEnrollment","text":"OpaqueEnrollment"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The server cannot build this — it never sees the plaintext — so it has to arrive with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request or not at all."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike the ","type":"text"},{"code":"srpEnrollment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" it replaces this performs I\/O: one ","type":"text"},{"code":"register\/start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" round trip.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OPAQUE’s envelope is sealed under the server’s oblivious PRF, so there is no offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"computation that produces a valid record.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the parameters that are gone. There is no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"identity"},{"type":"text","text":": the SRP version required the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account’s "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"username"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and an email there produced a verifier no login could ever satisfy,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whereas a record binds to a credential identifier the server chooses. And there is no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"group"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"params"},{"type":"text","text":", because those come from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"register\/start"},{"type":"text","text":" response — a caller"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot pick a cost the server will not honour."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" when the tenant has OPAQUE disabled, when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"libaxiam_opaque_ffi","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not installed, or when the server names a key-stretching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function this SDK cannot ask for."}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC16opaqueEnrollment8passwordAA06OpaqueE0VSS_tYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"opaqueEnrollment"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Axia